{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月に入りましたね~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月はね、なんと18歳になる月なんです‎^_^\n私の誕生日月だーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだ加入したての時は16歳で\nなんか歳だけでいうと大人になったなって思います！\n成人しますからね~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "17歳の振り返りと18歳の抱負はまた誕生日付近で書きたいなと思っています~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんは誕生日にはどんなことをしますか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "好きな場所にいったり、好きなものたらふく食べたり、家族や友達と過ごしたりー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はすこしドキドキしていました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月20日って夏休み1日目とか、夏休みに入ってることがあって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぎりぎり学校で友達に会えない、!?みたいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なので毎年新学期に入ると自分の誕生日は学校があるのかチェックしていました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の誕生日は6thツアー直前なので、好きな日が続いて嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、7月も一緒に楽しみましょうーー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/moboH6ZDt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob1MDGuW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobCchM9f.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobVgLbxU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobXZymUH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob9HoyGb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobsVHC5O.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobBUYPkt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年上半期の写真たちー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう2026年も折り返しですね、はやい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "下半期もよろしくお願いします！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/FasWElvoy9c?si=mJRVjHAthmZmZ4zd"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生ライブの裏側です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブ中のかっこいい四期生とはまた違った、わちゃわちゃしたりど緊張したりしている四期生が見れると思います💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん笑って、たくさん泣いて\nほんとうにほんとうに濃い時間でした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ、観てください~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日の25:55からのサクラミーツに出演させていただきます🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生ミーツダービー\nひな、ちひろ、わこ、ももみの4人で出走させていただきました🐎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めてのサクラミーツ、とっても楽しかったです！\nミーツダー